{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32950","headline":"哭李商隐 一 · 崔珏","name":"哭李商隐 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"成纪星郎字义山，适归高壤抱长叹。\n词林枝叶三春尽，学海波澜一夜乾。\n风雨已吹灯烛灭，姓名长在齿牙寒。\n只应物外攀琪树，便着霓裳上绦坛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔珏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32950.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32950","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}